    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Extract booking details from this hotel booking confirmation email (raw HTML) and \nreturn ONLY valid JSON with these exact fields, ignoring all HTML tags and \nstyling — read only the actual text content:\n{\n  \"guest_name\": \"\",\n  \"check_in\": \"YYYY-MM-DD\",\n  \"check_out\": \"YYYY-MM-DD\",\n  \"deluxe_rooms\": 0,\n  \"suite_rooms\": 0,\n  \"total_amount\": 0,\n  \"advance_paid\": 0,\n  \"booking_id\": \"\"\n}\n\nRoom types are usually listed as \"Standard AC Room\" or similar — treat \nthese as Deluxe unless explicitly labeled Suite. Count total rooms based \non the \"X Room(s)\" summary and the individual room type lines shown.\n\nFor advance_paid: if the email indicates the booking is fully \"PREPAID\" \nor shows \"Payment Status: Paid Online\" with no separate advance mentioned, \nset advance_paid equal to total_amount (treat as fully paid). If a specific \npartial/advance amount is mentioned, use that exact figure. If nothing \nabout payment status is mentioned, set advance_paid to 0.\n\nEmail content:\n{{ $json.html }}",
        "needsFallback": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        176,
